agent-framework-benchmark-pi

Built on agent-framework-benchmark by Nolan Lawson
https://github.com/nolanlawson/agent-framework-benchmark (Apache-2.0), included as the
`upstream/` git submodule. tasks/extend-team/gold/ is a modified copy of upstream's
gold/ reference implementation.

The Opus baseline numbers come from
https://github.com/nolanlawson/agent-framework-benchmark-results, which is downloaded at
setup time and not redistributed here.
